                    },
                    "message": "\"This property shall contain the peak sensor value since the last `ResetMetrics` action was performed or since the service last reset the time-based property values.\"\n\n\nThat description doesn't match up with the definition of xyz.openbmc_project.Common.TelemetryLimits.LimitType.PeakValue\n\nI don't see any connection to the Telemetry daemon that owns ResetMetrics."
